OL,3,GNEWSAEx-estate agent jailed over 19
OL,4,Acannabis factories
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe director of an estate agents who
OL,7,Fused his business to set up 19 cannabis
OL,8,Ffactories has been sentenced.
OL,10,FSarfraz Farooq, 46, from Luton, created
OL,11,Ffalse tenancy agreements for properties
OL,12,Fthat were used to grow cannabis and was
OL,13,Fjailed for more than eight years at
OL,14,FLuton Crown Court on Thursday.
OL,16,FPolice raided 20 properties in Luton
OL,17,Fand Milton Keynes in 2024 and recovered
OL,18,Fabout 2,000 plants worth about
OL,19,F#800,000.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
